          "text": "Grand Magus Telestra greets opponents with a taunt about curiosity. She divides herself in combat, boasting that there is plenty of her to go around, then announces she will finish the job when she rejoins. Her taunts and remarks on killing show lethal confidence toward those who challenge her.",
